          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. A hand cart loaded with vegetables collides with an identical but empty hand cart. During the collision:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.261,
            0.117,
            0.888,
            0.168
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) the loaded cart exerts a force of larger magnitude on the empty cart. (ii) the empty cart exerts a force of larger magnitude on the loaded cart. (iii) neither cart exerts a force on the other."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.262,
            0.167,
            0.888,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) the loaded cart and the empty cart, both exert an equal magnitude of force on each other."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.227,
            0.201,
            0.89,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": [
