            0.83
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "15. A tractor pulls a harrow (a ploughing tool) of mass "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "m _ { \\mathrm { { _ 1 } } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " with a net force F resulting in an acceleration of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 1 } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The same tractor pulls a trolley of mass "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "m _ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " with a force F producing an acceleration of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . If the tractor now pulls the trolley with the harrow placed on it (with the same force F), then obtain an expression for the resulting acceleration in terms of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 1 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 2 } ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ignore friction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
